course: dictionary
lesson: 1019
title: Bonus: extra on top
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A bonus is something extra, added on top of what you normally get. «A bonus is extra money on top of normal pay, for doing well.» The word bonus tells you the extra is a reward, and it is not promised.
explain: Use the words around the word to check your meaning. Words like «extra», «on top of» and «for doing well» are clues. Try your meaning in the sentence: «Her bonus points gave her a higher score» still makes sense if bonus means extra points added on.
explain: Bonus also works as a describing word in games and quizzes: bonus points, a bonus round, a bonus question. Each one is an extra chance to score, on top of the normal game.
fact: A bonus is an extra amount on top of what you normally get.
fact: «A bonus is extra money on top of normal pay, for doing well.»
fact: A bonus is not guaranteed, so it may or may not be given.
fact: In maths word problems, total = pay + bonus.
fact: Useful phrases: «an added bonus», «bonus points», «a bonus question», «Christmas bonus».
exercise: «A bonus is extra money on top of normal pay.» What is a bonus? | *Extra money on top of normal pay | A late payment | A prize that is taken away | A bill you must pay
exercise: «The quiz had a bonus round, so Sam could score extra points.» What does bonus round mean? | *An extra round that gives more chances to score | A round for the youngest players only | A round that is cancelled | A round where nobody can score
exercise: Total = pay + bonus. Pay is 200 and bonus is 50. What is the total? | *250 | 150 | 205 | 300
test: «Her Christmas bonus was a nice surprise.» What does bonus mean here? | Something taken away | *Something extra and good, given on top | A school trip | Something bad
test: Which phrase means something extra that makes things better? | A late bus | *An added bonus | A lost sock
exam: Mia says bonus points are the same as normal points. What is the best answer? | Yes, but only at school | No, bonus points take points away | Yes, they are exactly the same and there is no difference | *No, bonus points are extra points added on top of normal points
